{"id":"n55405-4-4","stage":4,"title":"맺히다 · 淤","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55405-4-4-1","ko":"어혈이 있으셔서 어깨가 아프신 거예요.","zh":"您是肩膀疼，因为体内有瘀血吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어혈이","meaning":"瘀血","explanation":"어혈：瘀血；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"어혈","audio":"/audio/d1e1b0a7cf7f75b03473.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:어혈:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"어혈","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어혈이","audio":"/audio/7fdafae6a142063544d0.mp3"}},{"text":"있으셔서","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；으시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있으셔서","audio":"/audio/89a8c0a1efd601f9c303.mp3"}},{"text":"어깨가","meaning":"肩，肩膀","explanation":"어깨：肩，肩膀；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"어깨","audio":"/audio/7881b57e7d18b91acaf0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29970","senseId":"1","lemma":"어깨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어깨가","audio":"/audio/74d892669cfa7ee39c34.mp3"}},{"text":"아프신","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아프신","audio":"/audio/50fbb1653c19a8c1a5ea.mp3"}},{"text":"거예요.","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거예요","audio":"/audio/ce83694d33e9399b0229.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d1e1b0a7cf7f75b0","term":"어혈","zh":"瘀血","audio":"/audio/d1e1b0a7cf7f75b03473.mp3","definition":"韩医学中指体内血液运行不畅或停滞的状态；这里是词义解释。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"7881b57e7d18b91a","term":"어깨","zh":"肩，肩膀","audio":"/audio/7881b57e7d18b91acaf0.mp3","entryId":"29970","definition":"从脖子下端到胳膊上端的身体的一部分。","pronunciation":["어깨"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/7430b8f1b52835459fee.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n55405-4-4-2","ko":"나쁜 피가 여기저기에 맺혀 있다는 말씀인가요?","zh":"您是说有不良的血液淤积在身体各处吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나쁜","meaning":"有害，不好","explanation":"나쁘다：有害，不好；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나쁘다","audio":"/audio/b67c592bde724aa15bfa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26816","senseId":"4","lemma":"나쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나쁜","audio":"/audio/e203b60c1df7f7cc3ba8.mp3"}},{"text":"피가","meaning":"血，血液","explanation":"피：血，血液；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"피","audio":"/audio/9c6661386be05570418b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73269","senseId":"1","lemma":"피","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"피가","audio":"/audio/0b0dd30901a0cfbac4b8.mp3"}},{"text":"여기저기에","meaning":"到处，这里那里","explanation":"여기저기：到处，这里那里；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"여기저기","audio":"/audio/9e2ef8f34a6bbf710011.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70994","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기저기에","audio":"/audio/979d3e60ddd7a8335af6.mp3"}},{"text":"맺혀","meaning":"淤","explanation":"맺히다：淤；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"맺히다","audio":"/audio/54d9a2812186fa7e7e94.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55405","senseId":"4","lemma":"맺히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맺혀","audio":"/audio/d1d33c8a61996f4e4b99.mp3"}},{"text":"있다는","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；다는：引用陈述内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있다는","audio":"/audio/3f5b0975fb8e95c3b8db.mp3"}},{"text":"말씀인가요?","meaning":"话","explanation":"말씀：话；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ가요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"말씀","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27365","senseId":"1","lemma":"말씀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말씀인가요","audio":"/audio/39e5bceb293da001a170.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b67c592bde724aa1","term":"나쁘다","zh":"有害，不好","audio":"/audio/b67c592bde724aa15bfa.mp3","entryId":"26816","definition":"不利于健康。","pronunciation":["나쁘다"]},{"id":"9c6661386be05570","term":"피","zh":"血，血液","audio":"/audio/9c6661386be05570418b.mp3","entryId":"73269","definition":"循环于人或动物体内血管的红色液体，其作用为供给氧气和养分、运输排泄物等。","pronunciation":["피"]},{"id":"9e2ef8f34a6bbf71","term":"여기저기","zh":"到处，这里那里","audio":"/audio/9e2ef8f34a6bbf710011.mp3","entryId":"70994","definition":"没有明确定下的多个场所或位置。","pronunciation":["여기저기"]},{"id":"54d9a2812186fa7e","term":"맺히다","zh":"淤","audio":"/audio/54d9a2812186fa7e7e94.mp3","entryId":"55405","definition":"血液聚在一起，凝结在皮肤里。","pronunciation":["매치다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"9fa325aa12d3fdd0","term":"말씀","zh":"话","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3","entryId":"27365","definition":"(敬语)别人的言语。","pronunciation":["말ː씀"]}],"audio":"/audio/380fa07e643261ffc882.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.99